1	//! `rtk codeflow cost` — cost attribution report for the current project.
2	//!
3	//! Subcommands:
4	//!   codeflow cost                  — project summary
5	//!   codeflow cost --by pr          — breakdown by PR
6	//!   codeflow cost --by dev         — breakdown by developer
7	//!   codeflow cost --by model       — breakdown by model
8	//!   codeflow cost --by day         — daily trend
9	//!   codeflow cost --pr <ref>       — specific PR detail
10	//!   codeflow cost --json           — machine-readable JSON
11	
12	use anyhow::{Context, Result};
13	use colored::Colorize;
